*E_NAME		"Pitchman Dela"

*E_CHAT		"This potion is made from natural    spring water. Priestesses wash      themselves in the spring from time  to time. It's very effective!!"
*E_CHAT		"Vital water from this spring is for sale. If you need vital water or    have items to sell, let me know."
*E_CHAT		"Not everyone can enter the Beehive  Cave in the westside of the Land of Dusk. "
*E_CHAT		"Beedogs and Devilish Tree in the    Forest of Spirits outh of here,     produce honey and mysterious oil.   What are they for?"